## Interface: 120100, 50504, 20506, 11509
## Title: MoltenCodes Test
## Notes: Development harness that runs the MoltenCodes real-client test suites with /mct and saves their results.
## Author: MoltenCodes
## Version: 1.0.0
## Dependencies: MoltenCodes
## SavedVariables: MoltenCodesTestResults
## X-Category: Development Tools
## X-License: MIT

# Development only: never ship this addon. See tests/client/README.md.
#
# TestKit.lua and Expected.lua are written here by
# `python3 -m tooling.client.install`; they are not committed. TestKit.lua is a
# fresh copy of packages/testKit/src/TestKit.lua (TestKit is a development
# package, so the MoltenCodes bundle never carries it), and Expected.lua lists
# every package the installed bundle carries with its API and revision.
TestKit.lua
Expected.lua
Harness.lua
